WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The model sees the measurements and the Luna/Sol labels. Training changes its internal numbers to reduce the error. A weight is one of those numbers: it sets how much a measurement counts. We are not calling a chat service.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Goal: connect the demonstration with training your small model.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:38.000
In the fictional lab, the model makes a mistake and adjusts a weight after seeing an example. Your task: explain what changed and which known fact made the comparison possible. Hint: separate internal numbers from the examples' labels.

4
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.200
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
